            "id": 145550,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>if</code> ifadesine ekleyebileceğimiz <code>else if</code> ifadelerinin maksimum sayısı kaçtır?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Maksimum sayı yoktur</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Maksimum sayı yoktur.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145551,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>else if</code> ifadesini kodlayarak <code>level</code> değeri <code>12</code>'den büyük, ancak <code>17</code>'den küçük olduğunda konsolda bir mesaj görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"137\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &lt;= \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tutorial zone&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Mid-game challenge unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Endgame unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>else</code>, ardından <code>if</code> ve sonra <code>(level &lt; 17)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
